880 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PROFESSIONAL PROFILE\nA highly experienced and versatile graphic and digital designer based in Nottingham in the UK\056 During an extensive career in the creative industry\054 I\031ve worked on pretty much everything that comes my way with a drive and enthusiasm that has been the core to my success in the industry\056 Design for me has always been part instinct\054 part discipline\056 I\047ve spent my career helping brands say what they mean clearly\054 memorably and with a bit of edge\054 working across branding\054 print\054 digital\054 ecommerce and campaign design\056\n\nRight now I\047m designing across Pentland Brands\047 global portfolio \023 Speedo\054 Berghaus\054 Ellesse\054 Canterbury\054 Mitre\054 Kickers and Endura \023 spanning ecommerce\054 digital campaigns and brand systems across multiple international markets\056 I am also helping to drive the companies move into the use of AI\054 being selected as one of Pentland\047s AI Entrepreneurs\054 I\047m helping to deliver real\055world uses for this technology and identifying where AI can be a genuinely useful addition to our daily toolkit\056 My attitude to new technology has always been one of adopt and adapt\054 and make it work for us\056\n\nColleagues would tell you I\047m calm under pressure\054 straight\055talking\054 and happier solving a problem than complaining about one\056 I still believe good design rests on the same principles it always has \023 I just enjoy bending the rules\054 embracing new tools\054 and creating a bit of useful chaos to get there\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 881 0 R
     /Pg 872 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

