  << /ActualText (Pentland Brands\n2023 \023 Present\nDesigning creative assets across Pentland\047s global portfolio of sports and lifestyle brands\054 spanning ecommerce\054 digital marketing\054 crm\054 social media\054 print and internal communications\056\nDesign across Speedo\054 Berghaus\054 Ellesse\054 Mitre\054 Canterbury\054 Kickers and Endura\054 working within multiple distinct global visual identity systems side by side\054 ensuring consistent \046 cohesive comms across a wide range of internal functions\056\nProduce ecommerce content\054 digital campaigns\054 social assets\054 B2B communications and print collateral for international markets\056\nSelected as one of Pentland\047s AI Entrepreneurs \023 helping the wider internal teams explore\054 test and adopt AI tools in real production workflows\054 not just experiment with them\056\nCollaborate daily with international creative\054 marketing and production teams\073 help shape briefs and improve how the creative functional team delivers at pace\056\nImpact\072 Trusted to deliver for globally recognised brands while keeping quality and brand consistency intact across multiple markets\056\n\nHullabaloo Visual Communications\n1999 \023 2022\nMany years served here with a steady rise through the ranks\056 Was fundamental in the company\031s shift from print into digital\056 Progressed from Graphic Designer to eventually becoming the Creative Lead\054 directing branding\054 print\054 digital\054 exhibition and web projects for clients ranging from global manufacturers to local independents\056\nLed creative direction on hundreds of projects across branding\054 print\054 digital and exhibition\056\nBuilt client relationships that lasted a decade or more \023 several are still on my Selected Clients list today\056\nMentored junior designers and helped define studio standards as the work moved from being print\055based to adopting a digital\055focussed workflow\056\nWorked as part of a close\055knit team to build fun\054 positive\054 fast\055paced studio \023 always promoted a \030can\055do\031 attitude\056\n\nEarlier Career\nBusiness Design Agency \0501998\051\054 Red Rock Design \0501992\0231997\051\054 Remo Print \0501987\0231991\051 \023 the decade that built the foundations\072 print production\054 typography\054 layout and branding\054 and the discovery of desktop publishing that set the direction for everything since\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 883 0 R
     /Pg 872 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

